49a12,12,0,0,1-17-17L111,128,47.51,64.49a12,12,0,0,1,17-17L128,111l63.51-63.52a12,12,0,0,1,17,17L145,128Z\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"flex flex-col px-5 py-5 space-y-4\"><div class=\"space-y-1\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-zinc-500 tracking-wider px-3\">Core Platform</span><a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-2.5 text-base font-medium transition-colors text-zinc-200 hover:bg-[#151515] hover:text-white\" href=\"/\"><span>Intelligence</span></a><a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-2.5 text-base font-medium transition-colors text-zinc-200 hover:bg-[#151515] hover:text-white\" href=\"/account-health\"><span>Health</span></a><a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-2.5 text-base font-medium transition-colors text-zinc-200 hover:bg-[#151515] hover:text-white\" href=\"/extension\"><span>Extension</span></a></div><div class=\"space-y-1 border-t border-[#222] pt-4\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-zinc-500 tracking-wider px-3\">Resources &amp; Governance</span><a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-sm transition-colors text-zinc-400 hover:bg-[#151515] hover:text-zinc-200\" href=\"/methodology\"><span>Methodology</span></a><a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-sm transition-colors text-zinc-400 hover:bg-[#151515] hover:text-zinc-200\" href=\"/transparency\"><span>Transparency</span></a><a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-sm transition-colors text-zinc-400 hover:bg-[#151515] hover:text-zinc-200\" href=\"/api-docs\"><span>API &amp; Open Data</span></a><a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-sm transition-colors text-zinc-400 hover:bg-[#151515] hover:text-zinc-200\" href=\"/appeals\"><span>Appeals &amp; Delisting</span></a><a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-sm transition-colors text-zinc-400 hover:bg-[#151515] hover:text-zinc-200\" href=\"/report\"><span>Report Spammer</span></a><a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-sm transition-colors text-zinc-400 hover:bg-[#151515] hover:text-zinc-200\" href=\"/about\"><span>About AIBlockList</span></a></div><div class=\"pt-4 space-y-2.5 border-t border-[#222]\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"button-md flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-[#ff6600]/40 bg-[#131209] px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-[#ff6600] font-bold text-sm\"><span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#ff6600] animate-pulse\"></span><span>Am I Blocked? Quick Status Check</span></button><a class=\"button-md flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-[#ff6600] px-4 py-2.5 text-black font-bold text-sm\" href=\"/directory\"><span>Inspect Account Directory</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M204,64V168a12,12,0,0,1-24,0V93L72.49,200.49a12,12,0,0,1-17-17L163,76H88a12,12,0,0,1,0-24H192A12,12,0,0,1,204,64Z\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><main id=\"main-content\" class=\"pt-24\"><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-24 text-center sm:px-6\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#181818] p-8 sm:p-12\"><p class=\"caption-3 font-mono text-[#ff6600] mb-3\">HTTP 404 · NOT FOUND</p><h1 class=\"heading-3 text-white mb-4\">This page does not exist</h1><p class=\"body-3 text-zinc-400 mb-8\">If you searched for a social media handle, a missing record never implies that an account is legitimate or abusive. Use the directory to search indexed records.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3\"><a class=\"button-md inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-[#313131] bg-[#1f1f1f] px-3 py-2 text-white hover:bg-[#272727] transition-colors duration-300\" href=\"/\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M228,128a12,12,0,0,1-12,12H69l51.52,51.51a12,12,0,0,1-17,17l-72-72a12,12,0,0,1,0-17l72-72a12,12,0,0,1,17,17L69,116H216A12,12,0,0,1,228,128Z\"></path></svg><span>Back to home</span></a><a class=\"button-md inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-[#ff6600] px-3 py-2 text-black hover:bg-[#e55c00] transition-colors duration-300\" href=\"/directory\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M232.49,215.51,185,168a92.12,92.12,0,1,0-17,17l47.53,47.54a12,12,0,0,0,17-17ZM44,112a68,68,0,1,1,68,68A68.07,68.07,0,0,1,44,112Z\"></path></svg><span>Search directory</span></a></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"mt-20 border-t border-[#272727] bg-[#000000]\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"md:col-span-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"relative flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-md overflow-hidden border border-[#313131] bg-[#000000]\"><img alt=\"AIBlockList Logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-full w-full object-contain\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Flogo.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75\"/></span><span class=\"title-3 text-white\">AIBlockList.com</span></div><p class=\"body-6 mt-4 max-w-md text-zinc-400\">Independent, open source trust and safety infrastructure for identifying, verifying, and filtering abusive automated social media behavior without penalizing legitimate human or AI assisted communication.</p><p class=\"caption-5 mt-4 font-mono text-zinc-500\">Code: Apache 2.0 · Public verified dataset: ODC-By 1.0</p><div class=\"mt-4 rounded-xl border border-[#313131] bg-[#141414] p-3.5 text-xs text-zinc-300 max-w-md\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase text-[#ff6600] font-bold block mb-1\">Creator &amp; Architecture</span><p class=\"leading-relaxed\">Built by<!-- --> <a href=\"https://x.com/Agenticpirate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"font-mono font-bold text-white hover:text-[#ff6600] underline\">@Agenticpirate</a>. Independent open-source intelligence infrastructure for social networks.</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-[11px] text-zinc-500 border-t border-[#222] pt-2\">Concept lineage: Inspired by early automated reply classification research and community initiatives.</p></div></div><div><h3 class=\"title-4 text-white mb-3\">Platform</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li><a class=\"body-6 text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\" href=\"/\">Intelligence feed</a></li><li><a class=\"body-6 text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\" href=\"/directory\">Account directory</a></li><li><a class=\"body-6 text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\" href=\"/extension\">Browser extension</a></li><li><a class=\"body-6 text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\" href=\"/account-health\">Account health (Under the Hood)</a></li><li><a class=\"body-6 text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\" href=\"/methodology\">Methodology &amp; signals</a></li><li><a class=\"body-6 text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\" href=\"/about\">About &amp; project credits</a></li><li><a class=\"body-6 text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\" href=\"/transparency\">Transparency ledger</a></li><li><a class=\"body-6 text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\" href=\"/api-docs\">Developer API</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class=\"title-4 text-white mb-3\">Governance</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li><a class=\"body-6 text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\" href=\"/appeals\">Independe